Z||000003||Shaun41178||09-20-2001||08:23 PM||||A chip will add about 20 hp and around 20 torque.  only get the ADS one though.  All others stink.  You will whip mustangs all day long after that mod.  The power loader will add only 5 hp but used in conjunction with a chip you will see about a gain of around 30 total.  Chip is the best bang for the buck there is.  Get one!<P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR>Shaun41178@hotmail.com||||reg||1
