Z||000022||shizon'00||09-21-2001||03:40 PM||||Actually, the powerloader isn't just another marketing gimic.  I have several buddies with the powerloader on a C5 and they are all getting 5-8rwhp and a 14-15 rwtq increase in low end torque.  It really does wonders on the auto's.  These numbers are all dyno verified.  But what really counts is the track.  Autos are getting approx. .3 off 1/4 mile times on average.<P>Corvettes have torque management programs and this really messes with them more than it does with A/F and timing.||||reg||1
Z||000023||terryk||09-21-2001||04:21 PM||||I didn't say the Powerloader is a gimmick. It's a flash programmer.<P>Cooter, keep 'em comin'! See? I did it again and whoosh, right over the top.<P>TK||||reg||1
